      "description": "<p>Riyadh says it will retaliate after overnight attacks by Iran-backed Yemen group on oil facilities wound more than 70</p><p>Yemen’s Iran-backed Houthis have attacked four cities in Saudi Arabia, wounding more than 70 people and setting oil installations ablaze in what appeared to be a significant expansion of the Middle East war.</p><p>Saudi Arabia said it would retaliate after the overnight strikes – reportedly involving dozens of drones and missiles – that targeted several oil facilities in the country’s south.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/08/houthi-strike-saudi-arabia-oil-facilities-middle-east-war-iran\">Continue reading...</a>",
