    {
      "title": "Houthi attacks on Saudi Arabia trigger fire at oil facilities, 73 injured",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/world-news/houthi-attacks-on-saudi-arabia-trigger-fire-at-oil-facilities-73-injured-126090800377_1.html",
      "description": "Houthi attacks ignited fires at several oil facilities and utilities in Saudi Arabia's southern region Tuesday and wounded more than 70 people, Saudi authorities said.\nMaj. Gen. Turki al-Malki, a spokesperson for the Saudi-led coalition fighting in Yemen, said the attacks hit \"civilian and economic facilities\" in the Saudi cities.\nThe wave of Houthi attacks were a major escalation in the renewed conflict between an important US ally and the Iranian-backed rebels in Yemen.\nThe kingdom's Energy Ministry said operations at the oil facilities and utilities were temporarily suspended.",
